    "introTitle": "Culture & leadership",
    "intro": "This assessment reflects question styles used in Google's DORA State of DevOps research: Westrum-style organizational culture, psychological safety, and transformational leadership. Rate each statement from Strongly disagree (1) to Strongly agree (7). Higher agreement on these items is associated in DORA's research with stronger software delivery and organizational outcomes.\n\nComplete it individually or as a team—the conversation often matters as much as the scores.",
